From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:16:11 +1100
Subject: Add pictures to the Start menu

On the Little and Junior presets each Start menu entry has an icon (Pokedex,
Poke Ball, bag, save book, gear, exit cross, Safari flag). The window is one
tile wider and the trainer card entry is dropped so it still fits the menu's
tile budget. Icons use colours every field menu window already has.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

